
### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/health

### 2. Create employee
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@example.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "salary": 45000
}

### 3. Get all employees
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/employees


### Get one employee
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/employees/EMPLOYEE_ID

### Update employee
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/employees/EMPLOYEE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salary": 55000
}

### Delete employee
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/employees/EMPLOYEE_ID
